subject: (({first_name}, ))[[your old clients | the clients you already won | your CRM is full of revenue]]

{first_name|Hi there}, just checking in on the email I sent a few days ago. [[If you haven't seen it, | In case you missed it,]] here's the TL;DR.

I've been following {company_name|your firm} for a while. I'm a student who's constantly recruiting for coop internships, so I love the work that you're doing.

I know for a fact you've got years of past clients sitting in your CRM that nobody's called in a while. [[Guess what a lot of them are probably doing right now? Hiring. | A lot of them are probably hiring right now.]] You're missing out on hundreds of thousands in potential revenue.

I study software engineering at the University of Waterloo, one of Canada's top engineering schools. I've built internal tools for the Government of Canada (one is used by 17,000 staff) and for university research labs.

I'll build you a custom lead reactivation system that tracks all your past clients and books you {offer.goal} meetings in {offer.days} days. I'm confident I'll get you results, so if I don't, you don't pay me at all.

Are you down to hop on a 30-minute call {call.times}? I'll send you a Google Meet invite, or you can name a time that [[suits you | works]] better. Let me know.

[[Thanks, | Appreciate it,]]
William
